Email::Outlook::Message — packaged Perl tool
================================================================================

The standard container image includes Email::Outlook::Message 0.921 to convert
Outlook .msg files. See packaging/msgconvert/NOTICE for the archive checksum and
source.

Upstream distributes it "under the same terms as Perl itself", which is a
disjunctive dual license: the Artistic License 1.0 OR the GNU General Public
License version 1 or later, at the recipient's option.

Suchi elects the Artistic License 1.0.

Suchi invokes it as a separate distribution-provided executable across a process
boundary. It is not linked into, and shares no address space with, the Suchi
binary. It is aggregated with Suchi, not combined into it.

  Artistic License 1.0: https://opensource.org/license/Artistic-1.0
  Upstream: https://metacpan.org/dist/Email-Outlook-Message


